{"date": "2017-05-18", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2017/0518.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:18:57+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "fb793597b54473c018a136f81e24b16d92979706c422ab22c3d54bbed05196b7", "image_bytes": 218605, "last_modified": "Thu, 18 May 2017 07:43:31 GMT", "title": "忌流言蜚语", "title_kind": "忌", "source": null, "author": "贝聿铭", "author_roles": [], "ocr_confidence_min": 1, "review_flags": ["source_not_detected"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "你要想往新的一条路走，免不了很多人觉得很不大舒服，为什么要改？要改进是非常难接受的。要往前走，唯一的办法就是往前走。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1}
